# Kee — Goals

> **Template.** Copy to `vault/config/goals.md`. Each `## Goal title` is
> parsed by `kee/perception/goals.py`; bulleted `**Key**: value` lines
> become structured fields. The heartbeat surfaces deadlines that are
> ≤7 days away as actionables.

## Example goal
- **Status**: active        ← active | paused | completed | abandoned
- **Deadline**: 2026-12-31  ← YYYY-MM-DD
- **Project**: kee          ← any project slug from your dispatch_registry
- **Progress**: 30%
- Bullet describing milestones, blockers, recent moves
- Another bullet

## Another example goal
- **Status**: active
- **Deadline**: 2026-08-15
- **Project**: studies
- Whatever else — free-form bullets after the structured ones.
